check   Paste your AI's answer. Every "quote" in it is checked against the source.

rule words say 6..12
rule words sub 12..32
rule plain say sub in note blank : cid blake3 ed25519 hash signed emem: sha256 attester bundle merkle
rule typed make open resolve ask point extend witness compare world
rule carry give : {link} {index} {curl} {mcp} {a2a}
rule gallery show
